   "titulo": "Colors and adjectives",
   "texto": [
    "The colors go before the name: **kırmızı araba** (red car), **mavi çanta** (blue bag).",
    "The adjective does not change by gender or plural: **güzel ev**, **güzel evler** (pretty house, pretty houses).",
    "To say «This is», use **Bu…**; **şu** points out something more remote and **o** something far away."
